    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Human Lineage.</strong> The branch that kept the reach. Small frames, far horizons, the ancestor who learned that an island is just a problem you can outlast.</p><p><em>“The map says ‘stop.’ You keep walking.”</em></p><p><strong>Florensis.</strong> You are the diminutive lineage that survived by being the thing the predators didn’t bother to chase.</p><h3>Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid.</li><li><strong>Size.</strong> Small or Medium (choose at creation).</li><li><strong>Lineage Lean.</strong> Your lineage leans toward <strong>INTR</strong>—expressed primarily through Tier powers.</li><li><strong>Little But Persistent.</strong> Your speed is not reduced by being Small. You can move through the space of any creature larger than you.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
